{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1091269-un-earthly-beauty","id":1091269,"title":"(Un)Earthly Beauty","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-11T14:16:02-07:00","id":1091269,"title":"(Un)Earthly Beauty","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Autumn sidhe are markedly different than their Arcadian counterparts. While Arcadian sidhe are noted for their inhuman splendor, the grace and power of an Autumn sidhe lies in her more down-to-earth beauty. Autumn sidhe appear to be the pinnacle of human beauty with all its foibles, oddities, and asymmetry.<span style=\"font-family:inherit\">These sidhe are stunning in a human way that makes them more approachable and understandable than the alien glory of the Arcadians...</span>Autumn sidhe have been changed by the act of taking on the Changeling Way. Not as flawless as Arcadian sidhe, these changelings instead embody the wild beauty of human complexity. </div> </div> </div>I love this section of text that distinguishes Autumn sidhe as markedly different than Arcadian sidhe. It makes complete sense that staying behind disconnected them from the overwhelming, brilliant beauty that the Dreaming bestowed upon them and honed it instead to something that appeals to mortals. I want that distinction to be supported by the mechanics. As written, Unearthly Beauty leaves people awestruck and unable to act when the sidhe Invokes the Wyrd, so I've come up with a House Rule that makes them beautiful, but relatable. <br /> <br /> <b>Earthly Beauty:</b> Autumn sidhe stand out from a crowd and are approachable. Autumn sidhe receive +1 Appearance and +1 Charisma, even if this brings that rating above 